Build dependencies
PlatformIO Core 6.1.19 is installed separately under its Apache-2.0 license.
https://github.com/platformio/platformio-core/tree/v6.1.19
The pinned Tasmota source selects its ESP8266 platform, Arduino framework and
toolchain. Their own licenses and notices remain in those dependencies. Python,
GCC, patch and optional sanitizer runtimes are separately installed host tools.

Corresponding source
tools/build.py preserves a source-only project archive and the exact verified
Tasmota source archive alongside every firmware output. Together they contain
the editable modifications, upstream source, build recipe and dependency pins.
